OL,3,ATwo arrested in London on suspicion of
OL,4,Aassisting Iran's intelligence service
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested in London
OL,7,Fon suspicion of assisting Iran's
OL,8,Fintelligence service, the Metropolitan
OL,9,FPolice has said.
OL,11,FA 60-year-old man and 42-year-old woman
OL,12,Fwere arrested at properties in London
OL,13,Fon Wednesday as part of an
OL,14,Finvestigation into suspected National
OL,15,FSecurity Act (NSA) offences.
OL,17,FThe suspects, who were both held on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of assisting a foreign
OL,19,Fintelligence service, have been
OL,20,Freleased on bail under strict
OL,21,Fconditions until late October, the Met
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
