OL,3,ATwo arrested in London on suspicion of
OL,4,Aassisting Iran's intelligence service
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the arrests were not
OL,7,F"connected to any of the incidents or
OL,8,Fattacks" linked to Jewish and Iranian
OL,9,Fcommunities across London earlier this
OL,10,Fyear.
